WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:05.500
It's been more than a decade since hot-shot
rookie racer Lightning McQueen burst on to

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.400
the big screen in the first Cars movie.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.790
Now, he's back in Cars 3 with a cast of new
characters, as well as old favourites, to

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.730
get his life back on track.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:17.570
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, it's Jan here
and in this video I'm going to uncover some

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:22.070
amazing secrets and facts about the making
of Pixar's latest animated movie.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:26.430
I'm also running my special Cars 3 giveaway
on this video as well.

